      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00060",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "20 - The Mystery Shopper Service can be contacted at MysteryShopper@cabinetoffice.gsi.gov.uk . More information .",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "heading_path": [
        "Intention",
        "Unreasonable requests"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00061",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "21 - If the Crown Representative has been unable to resolve the issue, suppliers should contact the Government Chief Commercial Officer at cco@cabinetoffice.gov.uk .",
      "ordinal": 61,
